  "rules": [
    {
      "uid": "bd3c6e30-167b-4522-afd3-0c357df60f58",
      "alias": "r1",
      "statement": "Synthetic ticker policy: (1) When generating a base ticker, remove leading articles, legal/entity suffixes, and standalone conjunctions; then concatenate the initials of the remaining significant tokens in uppercase. (2) When a name has only one significant token after filtering, use the first four normalized letters of that token as the ticker, or the entire token when it has four letters. (3) When an organization name includes a trailing share-class designation, generate the base ticker from the organization name and append a period followed by the class letter. (4) Normalize punctuation and diacritics before deriving token initials: hyphens and apostrophes do not create ticker positions, and accented initial letters are reduced to their unaccented Latin equivalents. (5) For a significant token containing digits, contribute one character representing the token: preserve a single digit when present, and for a multi-digit numeral use its leading digit. (6) Keep the resulting base ticker compact, with the observed outputs ranging from two to four characters; do not truncate a four-character result formed from four significant tokens."
    }
  ],
